                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  <block type="comment" id="y6114"><field name="COMMENT">7) Blijf doorgaan tot de tijd bijna op is (TOTAL_TIME_S - 5 s): zoek gele POLLEN, zuig ze op en schiet alleen als er echt iets is opgepakt. Geen bal te zien: op een andere plek opnieuw zoeken (3 plekken); pas dan stoppen.</field><next><block type="variables_set" id="y6116"><field name="VAR" id="v_upCell">upCell</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="y6115"><field name="NUM">1</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="y6118"><field name="VAR" id="v_round">round</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="y6117"><field name="NUM">2</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="y6120"><field name="VAR" id="v_totalShots">totalShots</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="y6119"><field name="NUM">8</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="y6122"><field name="VAR" id="v_TOTAL_TIME_S">TOTAL_TIME_S</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="y6121"><field name="NUM">120</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="y6124"><field name="VAR" id="v_CAMERA_HEIGHT_M">CAMERA_HEIGHT_M</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="y6123"><field name="NUM">0.165</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="y6126"><field name="VAR" id="v_NEAR_X">NEAR_X</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="y6125"><field name="NUM">70</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="y6128"><field name="VAR" id="v_keepGoing">keepGoing</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="logic_boolean" id="y6127"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="y6130"><field name="VAR" id=