  <block type="procedures_defnoreturn" id="b451" x="1300" y="700">
    <field name="NAME">goToShootingSpot</field>
    <comment pinned="false" h="120" w="520">Rij naar de schietplek in het verlengde van de wip: dezelfde x als de omhoog-CELL, SHOOT_DISTANCE_M ervoor langs de y-as, met de shooter recht in de opening (SHOOT_HEADING = +90 voor RED AUDIENCE, -90 voor RED SCORING). Eerst met de AprilTags vanaf de zijkant (richting HIVE_HEADING) de positie bepalen en op odometrie naar de schietplek rijden; daar met de tags (recht van voren) bijstellen: zijwaarts als de fout &gt; 5 cm is, dan langs de rijrichting tot &lt; 6 cm; daarna precies richten (max 5 pogingen). Geen tag: 4 cm achteruit en opnieuw (de muur zit vlak achter de schietplek).</comment>
    <statement name="STACK">
      <block type="comment" id="tl1"><field name="COMMENT">De opening van RED AUDIENCE (y &lt; 0) wijst naar -y, die van RED SCORING (na de TIP) naar +y: kijk er recht in.</field><next><block type="controls_if" id="tl9"><mutation else="1" /><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="tl4"><field name="OP">LT</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="tl2"><field name="VAR" id="v_CELL_Y">CELL_Y</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_number" id="tl3"><field name="NUM">0</field></block></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="tl6"><field name="VAR" id="v_SHOOT_HEADING">SHOOT_HEADING</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="tl5"><field name="NUM">90</field></block></value></block></statement><statement name="ELSE"><block type="variables_set" id="tl8"><field name="VAR" id="v_SHOOT_HEADING">SHOOT_HEADING</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="tl7"><field name="NUM">-90</field></block></value></block></statement><next><block type="comment" id="b259">
        <field name="COMMENT">Schietplek in het verlengde van de wip: SHOOT_DISTANCE_M voor de omhoog-CELL langs de y-as (zelfde x), kijkend in de opening (SHOOT_HEADING).</field>
        <next>
          <block type="variables_set" id="b266">
            <field name="VAR" id="v_goalX">goalX</field>
            <value name="VALUE">
              <block type="math_arithmetic" id="b265">
                <field name="OP">MINUS</field>
                <value name="A">
                  <block type="variables_get" id="b260">
                    <field name="VAR" id="v_CELL_X">CELL_X</field>
                  </block>
                </value>
                <value name="B">
                  <block type="math_arithmetic" id="b264">
                    <field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field>
                    <value name="A">
                      <block type="variables_get" id="b261">
                        <field name="VAR" id="v_SHOOT_DISTANCE_M">SHOOT_DISTANCE_M</field>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                    <value name="B">
                      <block type="math_trig" id="b263">
                        <field name="OP">COS</field>
                        <value name="NUM">
                          <block type="variables_get" id="b262">
                            <field name="VAR" id="v_SHOOT_HEADING">SHOOT_HEADING</field>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                  </block>
                </value>
              </block>
            </value>
            <next>
              <block type="variables_set" id="b273">
                <field name="VAR" id="v_goalY">goalY</field>
                <value name="VALUE">
                  <block type="math_arithmetic" id="b272">
                    <field name="OP">MINUS</field>
                    <value name="A">
                      <block type="variables_get" id="b267">
                        <field name="VAR" id="v_CELL_Y">CELL_Y</field>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                    <value name="B">
                      <block type="math_arithmetic" id="b271">
                        <field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field>
                        <value name="A">
                          <block type="variables_get" id="b268">
                            <field name="VAR" id="v_SHOOT_DISTANCE_M">SHOOT_DISTANCE_M</field>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                        <value name="B">
                          <block type="math_trig" id="b270">
                            <field name="OP">SIN</field>
                            <value name="NUM">
                              <block type="variables_get" id="b269">
                                <field name="VAR" id="v_SHOOT_HEADING">SHOOT_HEADING</field>
                              </block>
                            </value>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                  </block>
                </value>
                <next>
                  <block type="comment" id="lx1"><field name="COMMENT">Aan de overkant (RED SCORING, na de TIP) 12 cm naar links (naar de rode muur, -x) staan: rechter voor de opening, de tags blijven in beeld.</field><next><block type="controls_if" id="lx2"><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="lx3"><field name="OP">GT</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="lx4"><field name="VAR" id="v_CELL_Y">CELL_Y</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_number" id="lx5"><field name="NUM">0</field></block></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="lx6"><field name="VAR" id="v_goalX">goalX</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="lx7"><field name="OP">MINUS</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="lx8"><field name="VAR" id="v_goalX">goalX</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_number" id="lx9"><field name="NUM">0.12</field></block></value></block></value></block></statement><next><block type="comment" id="tl10"><field name="COMMENT">Eerst vanaf de zijkant (richting HIVE_HEADING) met de tags de positie bepalen, dan naar de schietplek. Daar kijkt de camera recht in de opening en ziet de tags alleen vanaf |y| &gt;= ±1,48 m (dichterbij valt de CELL boven het beeld).</field><next><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="tl12"><mutation name="turnToHeading"><arg name="targetHeading" /></mutation><value name="ARG0"><block type="variables_get" id="tl11"><field name="VAR" id="v_HIVE_HEADING">HIVE_HEADING</field></block></value><next><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="tl13"><mutation name="localize" /><next><block type="comment" id="y6268"><field name="COMMENT">Altijd via de muurkant naar de schietplek rijden (eerst x = -1,4 op de y van de schietplek, dan recht ernaartoe), ook als de tags hier niet te zien waren: dan op odometrie (encoders + IMU). Vroeger bleef de robot dan staan, bv. vlak bij de muur, waar de CELL met koers 0 ±47° opzij staat en buiten het portretbeeld (±26°) valt.</field><next><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="y6271"><mutation name="goTo"><arg name="gx" /><arg name="gy" /></mutation><value name="ARG0"><block type="math_number" id="y6269"><field name="NUM">-1.4</field></block></value><value name="ARG1"><block type="variables_get" id="y6270"><field name="VAR" id="v_goalY">goalY</field></block></value><next><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="tl17"><mutation name="goTo"><arg name="gx" /><arg name="gy" /></mutation><value name="ARG0"><block type="variables_get" id="tl15"><field name="VAR" id="v_goalX">goalX</field></block></value><value name="ARG1"><block type="variables_get" id="tl16"><field name="VAR" id="v_goalY">goalY</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b275">
